  "conclusions": [
    "Every architecture/loss/augmentation variant lands within +-0.6 mm of 32 mm on the fixed validation split: the 7 s window protocol is information-limited by the unobservable window-mean velocity.",
    "PhysNet is clearly better than all adapted public architectures on synthetic data (-24 % vs IMUNet) and equal to IMUNet on real data once IMUNet is given the same extra rigid sessions; PhysNet needs less data to reach the floor.",
